{"v":[{"a":["إِذَا","زُلۡزِلَتِ","ٱلۡأَرۡضُ","زِلۡزَالَهَا"],"t":"When the earth is shaken with its quake","l":"Idha Zulzilati Al-'Arđu Zilzalaha","w":[["idhā","When"],["zul'zilati","is shaken"],["l-arḍu","the earth"],["zil'zālahā","(with) its earthquake"]]},{"a":["وَأَخۡرَجَتِ","ٱلۡأَرۡضُ","أَثۡقَالَهَا"],"t":"And the earth brings out its loads","l":"Wa 'Akhrajati Al-'Arđu 'Athqalaha","w":[["wa-akhrajati","And brings forth"],["l-arḍu","the earth"],["athqālahā","its burdens"]]},{"a":["وَقَالَ","ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","مَا","لَهَا"],"t":"And man says, “What is the matter with it?”","l":"Wa Qala Al-'Insanu Ma Laha","w":[["waqāla","And says"],["l-insānu","man"],["mā","What"],["lahā","(is) with it"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَئِذٖ","تُحَدِّثُ","أَخۡبَارَهَا"],"t":"On that Day, it will tell its tales","l":"Yawma'idhin Tuhaddithu 'Akhbaraha","w":[["yawma-idhin","That Day"],["tuḥaddithu","it will report"],["akhbārahā","its news"]]},{"a":["بِأَنَّ","رَبَّكَ","أَوۡحَىٰ","لَهَا"],"t":"For your Lord will have inspired it","l":"Bi'anna Rabbaka 'Awha Laha","w":[["bi-anna","Because"],["rabbaka","your Lord"],["awḥā","inspired"],["lahā","[to] it"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَئِذٖ","يَصۡدُرُ","ٱلنَّاسُ","أَشۡتَاتٗا","لِّيُرَوۡاْ","أَعۡمَٰلَهُمۡ"],"t":"On that Day, the people will emerge in droves, to be shown their works","l":"Yawma'idhin Yasduru An-Nasu 'Ashtataan Liyuraw 'A`malahum","w":[["yawma-idhin","That Day"],["yaṣduru","will proceed"],["l-nāsu","the mankind"],["ashtātan","(in) scattered groups"],["liyuraw","to be shown"],["aʿmālahum","their deeds"]]},{"a":["فَمَن","يَعۡمَلۡ","مِثۡقَالَ","ذَرَّةٍ","خَيۡرٗا","يَرَهُۥ"],"t":"Whoever has done an atom's weight of good will see it","l":"Faman Ya`mal Mithqala Dharratin Khayraan Yarahu","w":[["faman","So whoever"],["yaʿmal","does"],["mith'qāla","(equal to the) weight"],["dharratin","(of) an atom"],["khayran","good"],["yarahu","will see it"]]},{"a":["وَمَن","يَعۡمَلۡ","مِثۡقَالَ","ذَرَّةٖ","شَرّٗا","يَرَهُۥ"],"t":"And whoever has done an atom's weight of evil will see it","l":"Wa Man Ya`mal Mithqala Dharratin Sharraan Yarahu","w":[["waman","And whoever"],["yaʿmal","does"],["mith'qāla","(equal to the) weight"],["dharratin","(of) an atom"],["sharran","evil"],["yarahu","will see it"]]}]}